   flowchart TD
      Start([НАЧАЛО]) --> Polling[start_polling]
      Polling --> Update{UPDATE}
      Update -->|message: PHOTO| PhotoHandler[add_bottom_and_buttons_def_from_photo]
      Update -->|message: TEXT| TextHandler[add_bottom_and_buttons_from_text]
      Update -->|callback_query| CallbackHandler[callbacks_calculation_of_likes]
      PhotoHandler --> Process[technical_processing_form]
      TextHandler --> Process
      Process --> GenContent[generate_test_content_message]
      GenContent --> CheckRating{Есть рейтинг?}
      CheckRating -->|ДА| Extract[Извлечь like/super_like]
      CheckRating -->|НЕТ| Init[like=0, super_like=0]
      Extract --> Counter[like_counter при необходимости]
      Init --> FormText[add_bottom → текст]
      Counter --> FormText
      FormText --> AnswerOrEdit{Тип действия}
      AnswerOrEdit -->|новое сообщение| Answer[message.answer]
      AnswerOrEdit -->|редактирование| Edit[message.edit_text]
      CallbackHandler --> Parse[Распарсить callback.data]
      Parse --> InitState[Инициализация словарей]
      InitState --> CheckAction{action}
      CheckAction -->|✅like| IncLike[like += 1]
      CheckAction -->|✅super_like| CheckSuper[Уже есть суперлайк?]
      CheckSuper -->|ДА| Alert[show_alert]
      CheckSuper -->|НЕТ| IncSuper[super_like += 1]
      IncLike --> UpdateUI[Перевызов add_bottom_...]
      IncSuper --> UpdateUI
      UpdateUI --> End([КОНЕЦ])
